<% content_for :title,'入馆' %><div class="auth-layout"><section class="auth-story"><span class="brand-seal large">搬</span><h1>有些东西，<br>值得留一份。</h1><p>登录后可以收藏、评价、举报，<br>也可以为自己的 QQ 群认领一座馆。</p><small>入馆证与 QQ 身份完全分开。</small></section><section class="auth-form"><h2>凭入馆证入馆</h2><%= form_with url:login_path do |f| %><label>邮箱<%= f.email_field :email,required:true,autocomplete:'username' %></label><label>密码<%= f.password_field :password,required:true,autocomplete:'current-password' %></label><%= f.submit '入馆',class:'button full-width' %><% end %><p>还没有入馆证？<%= link_to '办一张 →',signup_path %></p><% if AppConfig.demo.enabled %><div class="demo-login-note"><p>想先体验完整功能？</p><%= button_to '使用演示馆务证',demo_login_path,class:'button button-ghost full-width' %></div><% end %></section></div>
